    "ControlCapture": "ControlCapture(tag, attrs, *, inherited_disabled=False); root start is not fed again; start(tag,attrs), end(tag), data(decoded_text), finished, build()->ControlSpec",
    "normalize_control_markup": "Single-element normalize_control_labels wrapper; canonical strings unchanged when no relevant state changes.",
    "legend": "First direct legend removed from body; legend_markup includes complete safe outer legend with class/style and descendants, legend_text holds plain content.",
    "normalize_control_labels": "normalize_control_labels(labels: Sequence[str])->tuple[str,...]. Already-sanitized labels supplied in final host tree/insertion order. Separate nonserialized synthetic roots preserve label boundaries; one per-diagram ID/radio/form scope; no state shared across calls."
